  "releaseNotes": "[Add] PSM DTOs declare their PIM counterpart through IPimMappable<TRecord>, IRequest<TRecord> and IResponse<TRecord>; PimMapper, ConstraintMapper and MergeResultMapper translate between the two models (#389)\n            [Update] Metamodel, textual grammar and generated code aligned with the SysML v2 2026-08 release (#383)\n            [Update] PIM members carry a Property attribute holding the xmi:id and multiplicity from the normative API PIM model (ptc/25-02-29)\n            [Fix] PIM types aligned with the normative API PIM model: PrimitiveConstraint specializes Constraint, Commit.PreviousCommits replaces Commit.PreviousCommit, and Commit.Change, Commit.VersionedData, Project.Branches, Project.Tags, Project.CommitReferences, Query.Project, Query.OrderBy and DataVersion.project are added (#388)\n            [Fix] Derived-property and operation implementations corrected after a verification round against the specification (#385)",
